 jointly wading into the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  markets to counter heightened volatility.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 He also declined to comment on whether Tokyo stepped into the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 foreign exchange\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  market earlier in the day when the dollar fell below Y100.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 The dollar is now at Y100.96.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Write to Takashi Nakamichi at takashi.nakamichi@wsj.com \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par -0- \par  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 (MORE TO FOLLOW) Dow Jones Newswires\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 June 24, 2016 00:32 ET (04:32 GMT)\f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJDN000020160624ec6o000d9\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw205\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal3075\pichgoal600
